  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agroecological production, nutritional consumption and local commerce.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smallholder farmers in El Salvador face a number of challenges to grow and process their crops secure better nutrition for their families and access markets to earn income. Centro Salvadoreo de Tecnologa Apropiada (CESTA) trains farmers to implement effective sustainable agricultural practices and launch rural enterprises to improve livelihoods. At the IAF we support community-led solutions to expand economic opportunity in El Salvador. CESTA&apos;s activities support smallholder agriculture and food production to enhance food security and ensure meaningful opportunities for communities to thrive. This grant is part of the IAF&apos;s efforts to address the root causes of irregular migration in Central America.</narrative>
  </description>
